1. Accepts one narrow rule: TCP port 80 from 172.16.10.0/24 to 172.18.51.1
2. **Drops ALL TCP, UDP, and any other protocol (including ICMP) entering on `eth2`** (the r6_r3 backbone link to router3), with 22 packets / 1848 bytes already counted

